# Line endings are part of the deploy pipeline: tools/release.py and the pwa tests look for the
# @release-* markers in sw.js / js/version.js. Keep every text file LF on checkout (this machine has
# core.autocrlf=true), except Windows batch files, which cmd.exe wants as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
